cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CSP-Analyzer in your work, please cite both the software and the paper it implements."
title: "CSP-Analyzer"
abstract: >-
  A fast machine-learning-based desktop application for automated analysis of
  two-dimensional NMR spectra in NMR fragment-based screening. It reads Bruker
  TopSpin peaklists, compares each experiment spectrum against a reference using
  computer-vision descriptors, and classifies spectra as active or inactive via
  a SMOTE-ENN / PCA / SVM pipeline.
